5. Tag values are never URL-encoded in `serializeTagsParam`, so tags containing `&`, `=`, or `;` would silently corrupt the URL.

6. `tagsValue || null` should use `??` per project conventions.

7. The removal of the `layout.xxx` migration path for localStorage-persisted filter state is a user-facing breaking change with no MIGRATION.md entry.

